---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

// Privacy policy v2 (CEO approved 16 Nov 2026). Source text: EA repo
// projects/gal-gone-green/website/2026-11-16-privacy-policy-v2.md, with the Meta pixel and
// Conversions API bullet from Lena's Meta audit s.9b (L-24: the policy names the pixel before it fires).
// Keep the date fixed: it changes only when the text changes.
const LAST_UPDATED = 'November 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Gal Gone Green"
  description="Privacy policy for GGG Cleaning LLC (d/b/a Gal Gone Green): what we collect, the tools on our website, text messages, and your choices."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-green-800 relative grain">
    <div class="container relative z-10">
      <h1 class="text-white hero-reveal">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-green-100/80 mt-2 hero-reveal">Last updated: {LAST_UPDATED}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding bg-cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-charcoal">
        <div class="space-y-8 text-charcoal-light leading-relaxed">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl mb-3">Who We Are</h2>
            <p>GGG Cleaning LLC (d/b/a Gal Gone Green) is an eco-friendly cleaning company based in Broadway, Virginia, serving homes and businesses across the Shenandoah Valley. This policy explains what we collect when you visit galgonegreen.com, ask for a quote, call or text us, or fill out one of our Facebook or Instagram forms, and what we do with it.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl mb-3">What We Collect</h2>
            <p><strong>What you tell us.</strong> When you request a quote or contact us: your name, phone number, email, property address and ZIP, the kind of cleaning you want, the size and details of the space, how often, your preferred start date, any promo code, and anything you write in the notes box. If you book, we also keep your visit history, payment records, and notes about your home that help us do the job (gate codes, pets, products you prefer).</p>
            <p class="mt-3"><strong>What comes with the form.</strong> When you submit the quote form, we also save which page you were on, the site or ad you came from, and the ad-click details Google or Meta attach to the link. That tells us which ad or page brought you in.</p>
            <p class="mt-3"><strong>Our Facebook and Instagram forms.</strong> If you answer a lead form on Facebook or Instagram, Meta passes us the answers you gave (name, phone, email, ZIP). We use them only to send your cleaning price and follow up on that request. If the form asks you to verify your phone by text, that code comes from Meta, not from us.</p>
            <p class="mt-3"><strong>Calls.</strong> Calls to our office line may be recorded and transcribed so we can follow up accurately. We tell you at the start of the call.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl mb-3">The Tools on Our Website</h2>
            <p>We use these on galgonegreen.com:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li><strong>Plausible Analytics</strong> counts visits and pages viewed. Plausible says it does not use cookies and does not track you across sites.</li>
              <li><strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong> records how visitors move through the site (clicks, scrolling, taps) so we can fix confusing pages. It sets cookies.</li>
              <li><strong>Google tag (Google Ads).</strong> We advertise on Google. The Google tag sets cookies and tells Google when a visit ends in a quote request, so we can see which ads work. Google handles that information under its own policy.</li>
              <li><strong>Meta pixel and Conversions API.</strong> We advertise on Facebook and Instagram. The Meta pixel sets cookies. When you submit the quote form, it and a message from our server tell Meta that a visit ended in a quote request, so we can see which ads work and show our ads to people who have visited our site. Meta handles that information under its own policy.</li>
              <li><strong>Google Maps address search.</strong> The address box on the quote form sends what you type to Google to suggest your address.</li>
              <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong>, our website host, may run a bot check (Turnstile) on the quote form to make sure a person filled it in.</li>
              <li><strong>Jobber</strong> is our scheduling and client software. Your quote request becomes a client record there. If Jobber is down, our email service (Resend) sends us the request instead.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl mb-3">How We Use What We Collect</h2>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li>To answer you, quote your clean, and book and run your visits</li>
              <li>To text, call and email you about your quote and your service</li>
              <li>To send invoices and take payment</li>
              <li>To find out which ads and pages bring in customers, and to fix our website</li>
              <li>To keep our records and meet legal and insurance duties</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3">We do not sell your personal information. We do not give it to anyone for their own marketing.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl mb-3">Who Else Sees It</h2>
            <p>Only the companies that help us run the business, and only for that: Jobber (scheduling and invoices), Quo (calls and texts), our email provider, our payment processor, Google, Microsoft and Meta (as described above), and our website host. We may also share information when the law requires it, to protect our rights, or with your say-so.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl mb-3">Your Choices on Cookies and Tracking</h2>
            <p>You can limit tracking at any time:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li>Set your browser to block or clear cookies.</li>
              <li>Use Google's ad settings (<a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener">adssettings.google.com</a>) to limit ad personalization, or install Google's Analytics opt-out add-on.</li>
              <li>Use Meta's ad settings (<a href="https://www.facebook.com/adsettings" rel="noopener">facebook.com/adsettings</a>) and its "Your activity off Meta technologies" controls to limit ads based on your visits to sites like ours.</li>
              <li>Block Microsoft Clarity with your browser's tracking-protection settings.</li>
              <li>Email us and we will tell you what we hold about you and delete it if you ask, unless we need it for a legal or tax reason.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3">Blocking these tools will not stop you from requesting a quote or booking a clean.</p>
          </div>

          <div id="text-messages">
            <h2 class="text-xl mb-3">Text Messages (SMS)</h2>
            <p><strong>What we text you about.</strong> If you give us your mobile number (on our website, on a Facebook or Instagram form, or by phone), you agree to receive texts from Gal Gone Green about your cleaning: replies to your quote request, quotes, booking and schedule confirmations, appointment reminders, arrival and rescheduling notices, follow-ups on your quote, invoices and payment receipts, and customer-care messages. Some replies may come from an automated assistant on our office line.</p>
            <p class="mt-3"><strong>How often.</strong> Message frequency varies with your service, usually a few texts a month.</p>
            <p class="mt-3"><strong>Costs.</strong> Msg &amp; data rates may apply.</p>
            <p class="mt-3"><strong>Opt out.</strong> Reply STOP at any time to stop getting texts. We will send one text to confirm, then no more.</p>
            <p class="mt-3"><strong>Help.</strong> Reply HELP for help, or contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@galgonegreen.com">hello@galgonegreen.com</a> or <a href="tel:+15712097745">(571) 209-7745</a>.</p>
            <p class="mt-3"><strong>Consent is not a condition of purchase.</strong> You do not have to agree to texts to buy a cleaning from us.</p>
            <p class="mt-3"><strong>Mobile information will not be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong> Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent will not be shared with any third parties.</p>
            <p class="mt-3">Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl mb-3">How Long We Keep It</h2>
            <p>We keep client and quote records for as long as we need them to serve you and to meet our tax, legal and insurance duties, then delete them. Call recordings and website analytics are kept for the period set in each tool.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl mb-3">Keeping It Safe</h2>
            <p>We take reasonable steps to protect your information. No method of sending or storing data is 100% secure.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl mb-3">Links to Other Sites</h2>
            <p>Our site links to other sites (such as Facebook, Google Maps and the Jobber client login). We are not responsible for their privacy practices.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl mb-3">Children</h2>
            <p>Our services are not directed to children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect information from them.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl mb-3">Changes</h2>
            <p>We may update this policy. Changes are posted on this page with a new date.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl mb-3">Contact Us</h2>
            <p>Questions, or want your information deleted?</p>
            <ul class="list-none mt-2 space-y-1">
              <li>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@galgonegreen.com">hello@galgonegreen.com</a></li>
              <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+15712097745">(571) 209-7745</a></li>
              <li>Address: 409 S Main Street, Broadway, VA 22815</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
